        "id": 138932,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-07T23:26:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I agree, but Frost doesn't have much agency at all, his option minus the suit is to never leave his protective environment. &nbsp;Also paying off the suit and earning his freedom is not realistically in his power, or at least it sounds that way in Tactics,</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>He could have sided with Baron Blade during any of their confrontations. There's no doubt that Baron Blade has the technical skill to maintain and probably upgrade his suit, and he would have every reason to do so.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:15:33.214Z",
