        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-07T23:36:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He could have sided with Baron Blade during any of their confrontations. There's no doubt that Baron Blade has the technical skill to maintain and probably upgrade his suit, and he would have every reason to do so.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It would totally be tempting to put one's own life in the hands of someone who tries to pull the moon to the Earth.</p>",
