        "created_at": "2015-04-08T09:51:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cool, those are some proper heavy-duty science goggles :D. Whoever that guy is, he looks like he's dressing up as Duncan's usual avatar (of the Yogscast).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Take the 40 odd minutes to watch this, it is an awesome series and the quotes on Tachyon's cards will make so much more sense!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IUvPfZqEftI\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Youtube link</a></p>",
